The '''2026 Galactic Combat World Championship''' is the twelfth edition of the [[Galactic Combat World Championship]] (GCWC), the premier international [[esports]] tournament for ''[[Galactic Combat]]''. The tournament is scheduled to be held from 7 to 12 September 2026 at the [[9Ryo Esports Arena]] in [[Okami]], [[Okaiken]]. It marks the first time the GCWC will be hosted in the Sanese archipelago since the [[2018 Galactic Combat World Championship|2018 edition]] in [[Aoyama]], [[Nakamizu]].

Sixteen teams will compete, four from each of the game's four competitive regions: Mesogean–Illypnia, North Kaftia–North Fosia, East Fosia, and Lurandia-Abyala.

